<!-- wp:column {"width":"60%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:60%"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>On-page SEO is everything you can change on a page itself to help it appear for the right searches. The page title that shows in Google. The headings. The wording. The images. The links to your other pages.</p>
